  "rationale": "From vpnGateway:initialAccess the attacker can reach ciRunner:execution, memoryDump:credentialAccess, workstation:exploitPublicApp, tokenCache:credentialAccess, appServer:lateralMovement, printServer:lateralMovement and mailArchive:collection. Every route to the target is blocked. kerberoast:credentialAccess needs wifiGuest, so the AND step ssoLogin:authenticate fails, which blocks fileServer, serviceAccount, dbReplica and codeRepo. dmzWeb:exploitPublicApp needs supplychain, so configSecret fails, which blocks vpnSession and dbLogin. browserStore:credentialAccess needs iotDevice (internet or exposedApi) or dmzWeb, so it fails, which blocks backupHost and shareMount. monitoringHost:lateralMovement needs kerberoast, browserStore or vpnSession, all unreachable, so secretsManager and vaultRead fail. None of the four parents of crownData:exfiltrate (vaultRead, shareMount, dbReplica, codeRepo) is reachable."
